## 5. Check 3-Digit Number

### 🎯 Problem

Check whether a positive number has exactly 3 digits.

### 💻 Code

```java
package p1;

public class ThreeDigitNumber {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num = 456;

        if (num >= 100 && num <= 999) {
            System.out.println("3-digit number");
        }
    }
}
```

### 🖥️ Output

```text
3-digit number
```

### 🔑 Important

A positive 3-digit number satisfies:

```text
100 ≤ num ≤ 999
```

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

